                  "id": "b_1wyw43n1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "data": {
                    "html": "<h2>About me</h2><p>I'm a mother of three who finally has time for the garden. For years I only had a few pots on the balcony; now I have a real patch of soil and far too many seed packets.</p><p>I live in a small village with clay soil, cold springs and a lot of slugs.</p>"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "b_bjn98w16",
                  "type": "text",
                  "data": {
                    "html": "<h3>Why I started this blog</h3><p>Mostly to remember what I planted where! But also because the best tips I ever got came from neighbours over the fence. This is my fence.</p>"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
